## Suite resolution

The architectural spec (`docs/architecture/architecture.yaml`) declares a single
service, `calc`. The subject scenario's `service:` is `calc`, and the registry
(`docs/scenarios.yaml`) places it at `path: tests/calc/calc_test.go`. The suite
root is therefore `tests/calc`, and the only tree you may write is:

    tests/calc/steps/

Confirmed by `tests/calc/scenarios/scenarios.go`, which constructs the run with
